DTSTART:20260817T190000Z
DTEND:20260817T203000Z
SUMMARY:All things software infrastructure
DESCRIPTION:Noisebridge Hackerspace Bring a laptop if you can. Meeting format: * Introductions. Background & goals/interests for the meeting. * Lesson or Demo * Questions & Discussion * Readings & Exercises\, for future meetings Find [past notes & more information online](https://www.noisebridge.net/wiki/Meetups/Infra). Find us also in #meetup-infra of [Noisebridge's Discord server](https://www.noisebridge.net/wiki/Discord#Join_our_Discord). | Source: DC415 San Francisco | Tags: security | https://www.meetup.com/noisebridge/events/315883902/
LOCATION:
URL:https://www.meetup.com/noisebridge/events/315883902/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:4847960a145539ed@zcyber-gtm.local
DTSTAMP:20260817T162520Z
DTSTART:20260817T190000Z
DTEND:20260817T210000Z
SUMMARY:❤️ Can Arduino detect true love? Let's find out! (CHM)
DESCRIPTION:Noisebridge Hackerspace ❤️ **Can Arduino detect true love? There's only one way to find out!** Build your own Love Detector using an Arduino\, a touch sensor\, and a colorful RGB LED strip. Touch the sensor to trigger dazzling light effects while a companion website calculates your totally scientific love score. It's a fun introduction to sensors\, LEDs\, and interactive electronics with plenty of room to customize your project. **Beginner friendly\, no experience required\, and all parts are provided. Just bring your curiosity and your sense of humor!** Please bring a laptop if you have one but don't worry about it if you don't. Instructions https://phptuts.github.io/CircuitHackingMondays/love-detector/ | Source: DC415 San Francisco | Tags: security | https://www.meetup.com/noisebridge/events/315854763/
LOCATION:
URL:https://www.meetup.com/noisebridge/events/315854763/
END:VEVENT
