DTEND:20260819T203000Z
SUMMARY:NashSec
DESCRIPTION:NashSec **Parking Info & Directions:** There’s a parking lot just past **Up-Down** called **DCR** — they have an agreement with the venue for **free parking after hours**. 📍 [Google Maps Pin](https://maps.app.goo.gl/hrwFqq4Sqtjy4xHP6) **Venue:** **Up-Down's Roof Top** — 927 Woodland St\, Nashville\, TN 37206 **Stay Connected:** Join our **NashSec Discord** — it’s the best way to stay connected between meetups. We share updates on upcoming events\, promote local and regional security conferences\, and even host the occasional virtual hangout. **Discord Link** [https://discord.gg/nashsec](https://discord.gg/nashsec) | Source: NashSec | Tags: security | https://www.meetup.com/nashsec/events/314569451/
