SUMMARY:Leading Under Pressure Workshop (Lisle - hosted by Devry University)
DESCRIPTION:<h2>🔖 <strong>Reserve Your Seat</strong></h2><p>Thank you for your interest in <strong>Leading Under Pressure</strong>.</p><p>To preserve a highly interactive learning environment\, each workshop is intentionally limited to <strong>10 cybersecurity professionals</strong>.</p><p><strong>Reserving your seat is a simple two-step process:</strong></p><h1>➡ <strong>Step 1 — Register Here on Luma</strong></h1><p><a href="https://luma.com/rgf15qu6">https://luma.com/rgf15qu6</a></p><p>There is <strong>no payment required during registration.</strong></p><hr /><h1>➡ <strong>Step 2 — Complete Payment</strong></h1><p>Within one business day\, you'll receive a personal confirmation email from Steve Shelton with a secure <strong>Square payment link</strong>.</p><p><strong>Workshop Fee:</strong> <strong>$450</strong></p><p>Once payment is received\, your registration will be confirmed and you'll receive:</p><p>✔ Calendar invitation</p><p>✔ Workshop logistics &amp\; parking information</p><p>✔ What to expect</p><p>✔ CPE information</p><p>✔ Pre-workshop details</p><hr /><p>Cybersecurity leaders spend years learning how to protect systems.</p><p>Very few are ever taught how to protect <strong>their own leadership capacity</strong> while operating under sustained pressure.</p><p><strong>Leading Under Pressure</strong> is Green Shoe Consulting's flagship leadership workshop and part of our <strong>Monthly Leadership Series</strong>\, designed exclusively for cybersecurity professionals who want to lead more intentionally\, communicate more effectively\, and sustain high performance throughout demanding careers.</p><p>This is <strong>not</strong> a stress management seminar.</p><p>This is an interactive leadership development experience built around the real operational challenges faced by cybersecurity managers\, directors\, deputy CISOs\, and CISOs.</p><p>Because discussions are highly interactive and built around participants' real-world experiences\, this workshop is <strong>not intended for cybersecurity vendors or sales professionals.</strong></p> | Source: Chicago InfoSec Events Calendar | Tags: ciso\, cyber\, cybersecurity\, infosec\, security | https://luma.com/rgf15qu6">https://luma.com/rgf15qu6</a></p><p>There
LOCATION:
URL:https://luma.com/rgf15qu6">https://luma.com/rgf15qu6</a></p><p>There
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:52f4efd429770fc1@zcyber-gtm.local
DTSTAMP:20260817T162520Z
DTSTART:20260924T180000Z
DTEND:20260924T235500Z
SUMMARY:BurbSec East - Sponsored by Aikido!!
DESCRIPTION:BurbSec Chicago: The Midwest's Favorite Cybersecurity Events This month's sponsor is [AIKIDO!!](https://www.aikido.dev/) 🚀🔐 **Unlock the Excitement at Burbsec!** 🍻🎉 Are you ready for a night of geeking out\, making new friends\, and expanding your network in the world of infosec? Look no further—Burbsec East is the place to be\, and everyone is welcome! We have **NO DUES\, NO PRESENTATIONS\, and NO PUSHY SALESPEOPLE OR RECRUITERS!** 👥 **A Community Just Like You:** We're just like you\, and you'll fit right in! Whether you're passionate about infosec\, love indulging in memes\, enjoy a good beer\, or appreciate compliance jokes (among other things)\, we've got you covered. Our diverse skill set ranges from novice to expert\, and yes\, we even dabble in paper hat making! 🎩✨ 🤝 **Connections That Matter:** At Burbsec East\, you'll find more than just like-minded people. You'll make valuable contacts\, form genuine friendships\, and expand your network of professional connections. These are the kinds of connections that come in handy when you're tackling that thorny problem at work\, at home\, or in the job market. 💡 **Knowledge Exchange:** Whether you're seeking answers to tough questions or ready to share your expertise\, there's always someone at Burbsec East who's got your back. We thrive in a collaborative atmosphere where knowledge flows freely\, and camaraderie is key. This month's sponsor is [AIKIDO!!](https://www.aikido.dev/) 🕕 **Flexible Timing:** Don't worry about being fashionably late! People will start rolling in after work around 6 pm\, and we keep the vibe going until we're done (generally 4-6 hours) 🌐 **Stay Connected:** Don't miss out on the latest updates and community banter! Join the BurbSec Discord and follow us on Twitter for all the behind-the-scenes action and event sneak peeks. **Information Superhighway World Wide Web Presence:** Discord: [(](%5D(https%3A//discord.gg/zfkTdnTf)%5Bhttps://discord.gg/4hhVPHebJX%5D(https://discord.gg/4hhVPHebJX)%5B)](https://discord.gg/zfkTdnTf) Web: ([http://burbsec.com/](http://burbsec.com/)) Twitter: [@burbseceast](https://www.x.com/burbseceast) BlueSky:[ @east.burbsec.com](https://bsky.app/profile/east.burbsec.com)d | Source: BurbSec Chicago | Tags: compliance\, cyber\, cybersecurity\, infosec\, security | https://www.meetup.com/burbsec/events/314595012/
LOCATION:
URL:https://www.meetup.com/burbsec/events/314595012/
END:VEVENT
